laneflow v0.1

# Example 01 — Linear process, single lane.
# All flows are sequence flows (intra-lane, solid arrows).
# Teaches: header, lane declaration, four shape types, plain arrows.

lane Sales "Sales"

Sales: start    (Order received)
Sales: verify   [Verify order details]
Sales: confirm  [Confirm order with customer]
Sales: send     [Send confirmation email]
Sales: done     ((Order confirmed))

start --> verify --> confirm --> send --> done
